></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h1 class=\"gh-h gh-h--1 gh-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our Story</span></h1><p class=\"gh-lede gh-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">How we met, what this is, and where it is going. Short on purpose; the long version lives in Our Adventures.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"chapters\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"How we met\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><ol class=\"gh-spine\" aria-label=\"Chapters\"><li id=\"how-we-met\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">01</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">1</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Meeting</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How we met</span></h2><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-prose--lead\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We met at Allison and Jamie’s wedding.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Flirty glances across the room, and an immediate connection.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the rest of the story — who noticed whom first, what was said, and what happened after the last dance.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"the-connection\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">02</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">2</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Connection</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">The connection</span></h2><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Best friendship. Peace. Becoming better together.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Those are Tyler’s words for what this is, and they are the seed of everything on this page.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the story of how the connection became a relationship, in your own words.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"our-life-together\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">03</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">3</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Together</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Our life together</span></h2><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The places that shaped us: the Museum of Ice Cream, Richardson Farm, Michael Jordan’s Steakhouse, food tastings, gardening together, the Madison waterfront, and Starved Rock.</span></p><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">You can wander through them on Our Adventures, and borrow a few for your own weekend on Share an Adventure.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">which adventures to tell in full, and the photos to go with them.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"love\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">04</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">4</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Love</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Love</span></h2><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">We said “I love you” for the first time at Starved Rock.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">which trail, what day, and who said it first are yours to tell.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</span></span></span></p></div></li><li id=\"greater-together\" class=\"gh-spine__act\"><span class=\"gh-plaque gh-plaque--act gh-spine__plaque\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">05</span></span><span class=\"sr-only\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Chapter </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">5</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">.</span></span><p class=\"gh-eyebrow\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Ahead</span></p><h2 class=\"gh-h gh-h--2 gh-spine__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Greater together than alone</span></h2><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Mutual support. Being each other’s rock. Home. Gratitude. A deliberate partnership.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">what the next chapter looks like, in your words.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"gh-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__source\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--muted\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">From Sara + Tyler</span></span> <span><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Tyler's brief 2026-09-04</s